// IntroString :
"P3718143800" "You've heard of Siren's Call, haven't you? Frankly, it's a war zone right now. Lord Recluse is looking to push into Paragon City from there, and Paragon City is trying to push right back. It wouldn't do any harm to your reputation if you were to head over there and throw down for Arachnos. Why don't you talk to Operative Massey? I'm sure he could use your help. <br><br> <color red>Operative Massey's tasks will send you into a PVP zone, where you may be killed by other players.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1664860870" "Talk to Operative Massey"
// SendOffString :
"P3940457540" "You can get to Siren's Call through Sharkhead Isle."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P452316755" "I told Operative Massey you'd show. I wouldn't recommend you disappoint him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2999780388" "If you're ready to hang with the big boys, maybe you can help us win this war in Siren's Call. You do that, Arachnos'll be grateful. <color red>Siren's Call is a PVP area. Do not accept my tasks if you are not willing to face heroes who are trying to kill you.</color>"

