// IntroString :
"P1436244589" "You've heard of Siren's Call, haven't you? Frankly, it's a war zone right now. Lord Recluse is looking to push into Paragon City from there, and Paragon City is trying to push right back. It wouldn't do any harm to your reputation if you were to head over there and throw down for Arachnos. Why don't you go talk to the Warzone Liason in Sharkhead Isle? I'm sure he could use your help. <br><br> <color red>Siren's Call is a PVP zone, where you may be killed by other players.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P897284462" "Talk to Warzone Liason"
// SendOffString :
"P2203826216" "The liason can help you find the right contacts in Siren's Call."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1151156314" "I told the Warzone Liason you'd show."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3846708402" "If you know anything about Siren's Call, you know that it's a bloodbath in there. Don't go in if you can't handle that. If you're tough enough, though, you can talk to Operative Massey. He's got the skinny on all sorts of missions that will help swing the battle in Arachnos' favor. Or you can talk to the Arbiter at the Arachnos base; he can tell you all about bounties. <br><br>Siren's Call is a PVP zone. If you enter, you may be killed by other players. Do not enter if you are not willing to risk this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3357074880" "The takeover of Siren's Call is one of the crucial elements of Lord Recluse's plan. If you can make your name there, it'll make a big difference to your reputation with Arachnos."
